      "M=max(R,G,B);m=min(R,G,B);d=M-m;S=M!=0?d/M:0;V=M",
      "IfM==R:h=(G-B)/(d+epsilon);else ifM==G:h=(B-R)/(d+epsilon)+2;else:h=(R-G)/(d+epsilon)+4",
